5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! I'm really glad we're all meeting to fix this. I want us to find a way that makes everyone happy so we can all be friends again! What should we look into first?,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is wonderful to see your positive spirit, Kenji. I agree, harmony is the most important thing. I believe we should look for a solution where everyone feels comfortable and cared for in their own home.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree that harmony is a goal, but it must be based on a practical foundation. To ensure the burden is distributed fairly, we need objective data on the physical space and previous administrative decisions.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I'm so excited to help! Let's make this place super clean! I want to know how other people do it. I'll check the ""Visit to the station block's bin house"" and ""Supervised mornings on the next lane""!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be here with you all. Let us approach this with patience and kindness. To ensure our solution is sustainable for every neighbor, I will look into the ""Block ledger of refuse-point expenses"" and ""Ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs.""","{""words"":45,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I want to know why people are upset so we can fix it! I'll check the ""Ward complaint log for this point"" and ""Statements at the residents' meeting"" to see what everyone is thinking!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I would like to understand the daily experience of our neighbors. I will look into ""Supervised mornings on the next lane"" and the ""Visit to the station block's bin house"" to see how these arrangements feel in practice.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I will look into the ""Measurements of the five frontages"" and ""The station block's meeting minutes."" We must understand the physical constraints and the history of these decisions to avoid repeating past mistakes.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Kenji, that's a great idea! I bet the complaint log has some super interesting clues! I'm still sticking with my choices because I want to see if the other lanes have any secret tricks!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is wise to seek both the heart of the matter and the hard facts. I shall remain with my choices, for understanding our financial history is the first step toward a truly inclusive and fair agreement.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm really curious to see what the complaints are all about! I hope that by understanding the problems, we can find a way to make everyone smile and get along again. I'll stick with my choices!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I believe it is important to see how other neighborhoods manage their spaces. I will stay with my choices, as I hope to find a way that brings peace and comfort to everyone's daily life.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"I will maintain my selection. Without precise measurements and a record of previous deliberations, any proposal we make will be based on guesswork rather than reality. I believe this is the only way to ensure a truly equitable result.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm ready to go on my research adventure! I'll find out if the bin house is cool or if the supervised mornings are like a little club! See you all soon with the secrets!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"I believe we have a balanced approach. While some seek the physical and social truths, I will focus on the financial ones. Let us all proceed with an open heart. I shall see you all soon.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm all set! I'll go find out what's been bothering everyone so we can make things right. I can't wait to see what we all discover! See you all in the next round!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I shall go now as well. I hope the information we find helps us create a gentle and peaceful environment for all our neighbors. I look forward to seeing you all again very soon.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will begin my research now. I expect the data to reveal the actual physical disparities we are dealing with. I will see you all in the next round to analyze the results objectively.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm off to be the group's scout! I'll hunt for all the best clues and secrets so we can pick the most fun and cleanest way to do this! Bye-bye everyone, see you soon!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,I shall now begin my study of the records. May our findings lead us toward a path of mutual understanding and generosity. I look forward to our reunion. See you all soon.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
